{
  "_comment": [
    "Design-sandbox fixtures. Rendered at /preview (dev only, never in production).",
    "",
    "Purpose: build and look at blocks BEFORE a Storyblok space exists. These shapes",
    "follow storyblok-components.json closely enough to be useful, but they are not a",
    "contract — nothing here affects the real data path, and when real content arrives",
    "this file simply stops being used.",
    "",
    "Images use `placeholder://WIDTHxHEIGHT`. <PhotoImage> renders those as a coloured",
    "box at that aspect ratio, so no image files are needed.",
    "",
    "To add a block: add an entry to `blocks` keyed by its Storyblok technical name.",
    "It appears at /preview automatically."
  ],
